ol for indirect combat and puzzle solving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0Lore-rich environments that reveal the unsettling truths behind Serene Estates, its corporate backers, and the Actuaverse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0Multiple endings depending on how many you save or leave behind</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/e936823208d808b2713c2ecd702bac0b.avif?t=1761872843\" width=1496 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Life inside Serene Estates was supposed to be safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Now the walls themselves have become a prison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Will you escape Serena\u2019s grasp, or be her last obedient resident?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/88f28643a5720151adddf6ca79eabf58.avif?t=1761872843\" width=1560 height=511 /></span></p>","developers":["Team Serene"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/efced7863a12cd584145d4d876fb491585c197bd/header.jpg?t=1761872843","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mint<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-4700 2.40GH<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 765M<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Proton or WINE required to run</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akam